This plugin bundles data derived from Shortest Path
(https://github.com/Skretzo/shortest-path, commit 300e8de, version 1.22.0):
the teleport catalog in src/main/resources/com/cluehelper/transport/*.tsv is seeded from its
transport TSVs, with our corrections and extra columns on top. The world collision map
src/main/resources/com/cluehelper/route/walk/collision-map.zip is its collision-map.zip unchanged,
and the walking rules and in-game walk rewrite in src/main/java/com/cluehelper/route/WorldMap.java
and GameWalk.java are adapted from its CollisionMap and InGameWalkRewriter.

